      "text": "We identified several file names for the driver, for example: Ultra3.sys, msw32.sys, vstor32.sys. We have encountered 32-bit and 64-bit driver versions. The two binaries may be installed simultaneously on one system. The file containing the virtual file system has a random name, followed by the extension .dat. Furthermore, this file is located in the same directory as the driver file. The installation directory does change, but we were able to identify the following pattern:",
